{"4395290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FishOmatic", "steam_appid": 4395290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4804760], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/bd30de45a8615a55298d9432eeba0103.poster.avif?t=1782717486\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/bd30de45a8615a55298d9432eeba0103.webm?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/bd30de45a8615a55298d9432eeba0103.mp4?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Cozy Mission:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin a gentle new chapter on your own ocean island. With your loyal robot companions by your side, you will build a small fish processing business from the ground up. This life is a soothing blend of mindful work on your isle and finding your place in the welcoming community of the village across the bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/24506f877b6a5f6fd13dfb6e0a83496e.poster.avif?t=1782717486\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/24506f877b6a5f6fd13dfb6e0a83496e.webm?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/24506f877b6a5f6fd13dfb6e0a83496e.mp4?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Peaceful Daily Rhythm:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you tend to your cozy factory—expanding as needed, and adding new machines as required. You will deciding which fish to select for processing. Then, take to the waves in your trusty boat to scout for new, fishing spots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/f55970023aab02b3003f809902d0392a.poster.avif?t=1782717486\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/f55970023aab02b3003f809902d0392a.webm?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/f55970023aab02b3003f809902d0392a.mp4?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Helpful Robots:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your robot friends are diligent partners. Once you welcome a new helper to your island family, they’ll automatically set to work—tending lines, minding the machines, and doing their part to help your little haven thrive. They’re always there, making everything run smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/1f0419ec33d93ef56f241a1fc6e5dc14.poster.avif?t=1782717486\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/1f0419ec33d93ef56f241a1fc6e5dc14.webm?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/1f0419ec33d93ef56f241a1fc6e5dc14.mp4?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Designed for Comfort &amp; Curiosity:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a peaceful automation game, crafted for beginners and anyone seeking a relaxing simulation. There's no steep learning curve, just a gentle tide of satisfying tasks. Settle in, get comfortable, and watch your island dream grow, piece by peaceful piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/79949443332bb4902e31dd04bc4f9e5b.poster.avif?t=1782717486\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/79949443332bb4902e31dd04bc4f9e5b.webm?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/79949443332bb4902e31dd04bc4f9e5b.mp4?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/bd30de45a8615a55298d9432eeba0103.poster.avif?t=1782717486\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/bd30de45a8615a55298d9432eeba0103.webm?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4395290/extras/bd30de45a8615a55298d9432eeba0103.mp4?t=1782717486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Cozy Mission:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin a gentle new chapter on your own ocean isl